[{"answer":"My advice to a student from a foreign country would be to talk, talk, talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Talk as much as you can to the people who live in the place that you are visiting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Talk to them and practice your new language skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Learn all the funny sayings and different words that make up their language.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Talking is the only way to really learn a language.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Listen to people and talk to people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"If you talk to people, you will also learn about their culture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a friend from Japan. His name is Nori.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"He often comes to see me just so that he can practice his English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"He gets confused about words that sound the same, but mean different things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He was asking me about the words \"see\" and \"sea\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I explained to him that they do sound the same,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but they are spelled differently, and they mean different things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Nori is learning some of our funny sayings from different people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"One morning I asked him how he was, and he said \"alive and kicking\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Another morning when I asked him how he was, he said \"so so\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He laughs about these strange sayings that we use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"He is learning English quickly because he spends a lot of time with English-speaking people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"He likes to have lunch with my friends and me because","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"we ask him questions about his homeland, and he answers us in English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"If he doesn't understand our questions, we spend time explaining what we mean to him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He says that he enjoys being here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"He thinks that the people are very friendly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"We enjoy speaking to him and helping him to learn English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"We also enjoy learning about his country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It is enjoyable for us to meet new people and learn about new things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/163-advice-to-a-student-from-a-foreign-country-2019-04-07-04-35-19/26.mp3"}]
